      "role": "user",
      "content": "those small pauses don't even work. they're just temporary. within five minutes the noise is right back, louder than before. it's like i'm stuck in a loop i can't break. i look at people who actually seem... peaceful, or even just still, and it feels like they possess something i've lost forever. i just want the noise to stop for good. not just for a minute, but for real. i just want everything to be quiet.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
